]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Blocks stage contract and RB vectors in the bob-cli docs[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write the Blocks… stage contract as docs/task-dependencies.md [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]§15 (entry points, pool, ranking, rows, guards, writes, notices, chips, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]api.blocks, RB vectors). Update the cross-references in §5, §6.1, §8, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]§9, and §14.7–§14.12, plus docs/projects.md, docs/freshness.md, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/capture.md. No code.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reverse dependency writer with forward-parity tests[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]writer[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer: add a nav writer that puts sources N onto many dependents T [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]across notes, built on planDependencyEdit and the §6.6 prepare → commit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]→ mirror order. Prepare N once (id plus the strongest lane), plan its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]BLOCKS edit once from the T writes that committed, and aggregate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoro consumption. Prove byte parity with the forward writer on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]RBP/RBW vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The Blocks… stage modal[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]stage[dim] · [dim][/dim]after writer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage: add showBlocksStage to the property picker. It reuses the vault [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pool and needs a reverse CURRENT, swapped guards, and today-first [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranking. Add the 🔑 / 🍅 / k-of-n badges, the one-line consequence [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip, the dynamic footer verb, the block-ID prompt for N, counted [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sources, marks, stale reopen, the inbox-route gate, and review-origin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]continue.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task Card ⇧B row, Ctrl+Shift+Alt+B, and every other entry [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]point[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]entry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after stage[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]entry: add the Task Card Blocks… row (key ⇧B), the task-card-blocks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command bound to Ctrl+Shift+Alt+B, and counted N<Ctrl+Shift+Alt+B>. Wire[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Task Link, Depends-On-line, and BLOCKS-line entries, Ctrl+Shift+P on a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]BLOCKS line, entry refusals, the generated-line notice copy, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]api.blocks (openStage, removeDependent). Bump the nav minor version.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]BLOCKS chip ＋ / × through api.blocks[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]chips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after entry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chips: in bob-ledger-tools, give open-owner BLOCKS chip rows a ＋ that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]calls api.blocks.openStage and a hover × on live chips that calls [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]api.blocks.removeDependent. Feature-detect api.blocks, leave frozen and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale chips alone, and update the tooltip copy. Bump the ledger-tools [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]minor version. Gated by decision chips.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]README, manifests, glossary, and the final sweep[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]publish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after entry, chips[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish: document Ctrl+Shift+Alt+B and ⇧B in the bob-plugins README, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deduplicating it first if it still repeats. Finalize the manifest [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]descriptions, apply the glossary_dep_link memory decision, run the full [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]suites and bob plugins sync, and check the docs against the shipped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]behavior.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-8x","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-8x.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-2265d2241728e3aa9ce4fb348d6d0dfd","started_at":"2026-10-17T21:16:27.287108+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"c18df095059924cb560301485f325d79381e66875c1ea38b583954444f001273","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-8x.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"4b607e36856255090cef512d01b2d582f0bb98153ce1b3f65ffab0f26839146c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-8x.3/meta.json","size_bytes":684},"prompt":{"digest":"6df50df45752142423346aa41532d4338da3c978e0aea1928b87f55a8c7374d0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-8x.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":176},"state":{"digest":"a7eea68a58f1b84297f15f6828f3d960d9f2ba8fb61704ecc622e2a3b7f26b50","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-8x.3/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-8x.3","local_name":"bob-cli-8x.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-8x","agent_clan_generation":"20261017171407","bead_id":"bob-cli-8x.3","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-8x","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-8x.3","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_f